<h2 class="fs-37 lh-37 mb-24">Hero layouts</h2>
<p class="mb-32">Start with a heading, supporting text, two calls to action, and an image. This first example focuses on the layout; the image frame, section background, and final button styling can be added next.</p>
<h2 class="fs-24 lh-32 mb-16">Text left, image right</h2>
<p class="mb-24"><code>flex-md</code> enables a row from 820 pixels, and <code>flex-1</code> lets the two columns share the available space. <code>items-center</code> centers the text vertically beside the image. Below medium the content stacks in reading order. The two calls to action are ordinary links with simple utility styling, without a dropdown or extra JavaScript.</p>
